Why this commit: it is the commit upstream tagged `v1.2.0` (and `1.2.0`), dated
the day the npm packages @silencelaboratories/dkls-wasm-ll-{node,web,bundler}
1.2.0 were published (2025-03-18). The npm packages' JavaScript API (classes
KeygenSession, Keyshare, Message, SignSession, SignSessionOTVariant and their
methods) is the API of `wrapper/wasm-ll` at this commit. The published wasm was
not reproduced byte for byte.

Files taken from upstream at that commit, unchanged in the first commit that
added this directory:
  Cargo.toml  Cargo.lock  LICENSE.md  README.md  rustfmt.toml  src/  wrapper/

Not taken: .github/, .dockerignore, .gitignore, CHANGELOG.md, Dockerfile, ci/,
docs/ (the paper PDF).

Rust dependencies are not vendored. Cargo fetches them, including
sl-mpc-mate and sl-oblivious from
https://github.com/silence-laboratories/sl-crypto.git at rev f366497, as
pinned by Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock.

